{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/grafik.png?t=1741190997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/nice_background__diffrent_emotions_and_action.gif?t=1741190997\" />As the sun dips below the horizon, <i>Sundown</i> begins - an elite Storm Oak event where only the strongest make it to camp before night swallows them whole. Glory and honor await the survivors. Failure is unthinkable.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/branch1.png?t=1741190997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/salem_being_shot_at.gif?t=1741190997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Salem has trained for this moment, but when his secret boyfriend, James, emerges from the shadows, survival becomes more than just a test of skill. In this gripping demo of <i>Rottenroots</i>, navigate a treacherous forest, make split-second choices, and decide what matters most: victory, loyalty, or love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make it till sundown\u2014or die trying.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/branch2.png?t=1741190997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/witz__figuren_und_animationen_zeigen.gif?t=1741190997\" />This demo includes 45-60 minutes of gameplay from some of the first chapters of the game. Follow Salem as he enters the world of Rottenroots and meets his most important allies and rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/branch3.png?t=1741190997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLAY THE DEMO WHILE YOU CAN! Available for a limited time until March 15.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/grafik.png?t=1741190997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547500?t=1741190997","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/6a42d074bb064834ba69c6a6ef41555ff149b808/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741190997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/c58a35fe56d94ac7d96f8e0047359a0b32b606a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741190997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/c58a35fe56d94ac7d96f8e0047359a0b32b606a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741190997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/grafik.png?t=1741190997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/nice_background__diffrent_emotions_and_action.gif?t=1741190997\" />As the sun dips below the horizon, <i>Sundown</i> begins - an elite Storm Oak event where only the strongest make it to camp before night swallows them whole. Glory and honor await the survivors. Failure is unthinkable.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547500/extras/branch1.png?t=1741190997\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com